								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>【Restore Your Museum】</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >You’ve inherited a once-renowned museum that's now covered in dust and filled with misplaced artifacts. Can you bring it back to life?</p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870430/extras/fd2143d84cd241117bc96b0eb0b23d6c.poster.avif?t=1792515041" width=462 height=240 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870430/extras/fd2143d84cd241117bc96b0eb0b23d6c.webm?t=1792515041" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870430/extras/fd2143d84cd241117bc96b0eb0b23d6c.mp4?t=1792515041" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>【What You'll Do】</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Clean and Restore</strong></p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Remove dirt, clutter, and damage from exhibit halls.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Bring neglected rooms back to their former glory.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870430/extras/ecb1c942c722fefa58089374e26306b0.poster.avif?t=1792515041" width=462 height=240 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870430/extras/ecb1c942c722fefa58089374e26306b0.webm?t=1792515041" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870430/extras/ecb1c942c722fefa58089374e26306b0.mp4?t=1792515041" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Organize Hundreds of Items</strong></p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Find the rightful place for artifacts, fossils and museum pieces.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Turn chaotic collections into beautiful exhibits.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870430/extras/093d0b2e2ad8d76ebc62f57479ac609b.poster.avif?t=1792515041" width=462 height=240 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870430/extras/093d0b2e2ad8d76ebc62f57479ac609b.webm?t=1792515041" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870430/extras/093d0b2e2ad8d76ebc62f57479ac609b.mp4?t=1792515041" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Learn and Unlock new areas</strong></p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Learn about mysterious objects and determine where they belong.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Find keys to access locked exhibit rooms.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870430/extras/7d36bfcf8f33e1258b0b0e5ef9ccda2f.poster.avif?t=1792515041" width=462 height=240 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870430/extras/7d36bfcf8f33e1258b0b0e5ef9ccda2f.webm?t=1792515041" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870430/extras/7d36bfcf8f33e1258b0b0e5ef9ccda2f.mp4?t=1792515041" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Assemble Dinosaur Skeletons</strong></p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Collect fossils and piece together impressive prehistoric displays.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Complete skeletons part by part.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870430/extras/0cd4eb2aa987fbb03c39ccde553dce99.poster.avif?t=1792515041" width=462 height=240 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870430/extras/0cd4eb2aa987fbb03c39ccde553dce99.webm?t=1792515041" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870430/extras/0cd4eb2aa987fbb03c39ccde553dce99.mp4?t=1792515041" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >  </p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Level Up Your Skills</strong></p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Earn XP as you restore the museum.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Unlock new abilities that help you repair increasingly complex exhibits.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870430/extras/e6c71c6f3059f2686e9bba6969d97473.poster.avif?t=1792515041" width=462 height=240 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870430/extras/e6c71c6f3059f2686e9bba6969d97473.webm?t=1792515041" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870430/extras/e6c71c6f3059f2686e9bba6969d97473.mp4?t=1792515041" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>【Prepare for the Grand Opening】</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Every room cleaned, artifact identified, and exhibit restored brings the museum one step closer to completion.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Can you transform your unexpected inheritance into the museum of your dreams?</p>						</div>
					</div>
