		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					We are actively working to replace all placeholder AI art before launch. While we aim for a fully human-crafted experience, a few minor assets may still remain at release. <br />
<br />
AI tools were also used to assist with localizing the game and store page.<br />
<br />
All 3D in-game art was created by human artists or derived from real-world museum photoscans. (See the credits menu for full attributions.)				</i>
			</p>
					</div>
	</div>
	
				
				
